## คำสั่งเดียวที่ถูก

```powershell
..\..\..\van2\scripts\deploy-readiness.ps1 -App van1 -Target storage
..\..\..\van2\scripts\deploy-self.ps1 -App van1 -Target storage -ConfirmDeploy "APPROVE:van1:van-merchant" -FinalAcknowledge "YES I UNDERSTAND"
```

